# dxpane/site — ignore rules (shared baseline across dxpane repos)
# Stacks: .NET 10 · Node/React/Vite · Swift/Xcode · Python tooling · Terraform · Remotion
# Rule of thumb: secrets, generated output, local state and editor files never enter git.
# Note: git has no trailing comments — keep comments on their own lines. macOS is case-insensitive:
# avoid patterns like 'Packages/' that would also hide our 'packages/'.

# ─── Secrets & credentials (never commit; use Secret Manager / Keychain / CI secrets) ───
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
# App Store Server API / Sign in with Apple / APNs keys
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.keystore
*.jks
**/secrets/
**/*secret*.json
**/*credentials*.json
service-account*.json
*-sa-key.json
.netrc
.npmrc.local
appsettings.*.local.json
**/Properties/launchSettings.local.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

# ─── OS ───
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

